    "Name": "Tian Xie Zuo A",
    "Details": "The A configuration switches the Tian Xie Zuo from direct, medium range engagements to very long range. Its massive Railgun can deliver its devastating damage almost up to 1.5 kilometers away, and the 6 RAC/2 can follow it up with a true hail of fist-sized bullets. The Chameleon LPS armor allows the 'Mech to conceal its presence until it is able to attack, but even after revealed it has enough protection to survive a direct engagement by its foes.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.36</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_tianxiezuo"
  },
